## 7. Dockerfiles prêts à l'emploi

> Remplacer les registres publics par les proxys Nexus (Docker, apt, nodejs.org) selon la config interne.

### 7.1 Linux (cibles Linux)

```dockerfile
# electron-ci-linux
FROM node:26-trixie

ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive

RUN apt-get update \
 && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
      rpm \
      libarchive-tools \
      lzip \
      libopenjp2-tools \
      liblzo2-2 \
      git unzip xz-utils \
 && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

WORKDIR /project
```

### 7.2 Linux → Windows (Wine)

```dockerfile
# electron-ci-linux-wine
FROM electron-ci-linux:latest

ENV WINEDEBUG=-all,err+all \
    WINEDLLOVERRIDES=winemenubuilder.exe=d

RUN dpkg --add-architecture i386 \
 && apt-get update \
 && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
      wine wine32 wine64 libwine libwine:i386 fonts-wine \
 && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
 && (wine wineboot --init || true)
```

### 7.3 Windows natif

```dockerfile
# escape=`
# electron-ci-windows
FROM mcr.microsoft.com/windows/servercore:ltsc2022

SHELL ["powershell", "-Command", "$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'; $ProgressPreference = 'SilentlyContinue';"]

ARG NODE_VERSION=26.12.1
# Remplacer nodejs.org par le proxy Nexus de https://nodejs.org/dist/
RUN Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "https://nodejs.org/dist/v$env:NODE_VERSION/node-v$env:NODE_VERSION-win-x64.zip" -OutFile node.zip; `
    Expand-Archive node.zip -DestinationPath C:\; `
    Rename-Item "C:\node-v$env:NODE_VERSION-win-x64" C:\nodejs; `
    Remove-Item node.zip; `
    [Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable('Path', $env:Path + ';C:\nodejs', [EnvironmentVariableTarget]::Machine)

WORKDIR C:\project
```

